	(text "H2: fit shunt 2-3 for default 3.3V; 1-2 selects 1.8V. Power OFF before changing.\nGPIO bank follows VREF; header 3.3V pins remain 3.3V.\nMIPI1 / HAT I2C follows GPIO_VREF; verify peripherals in 1.8V mode."
		(at 25.4 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4dbdbace-5e18-479a-ab85-855114827642")
	)
	(text "BOOT: hold during power-up for USB recovery.\nPOWER: module power button. CM5 eMMC uses onboard storage;\nexternal microSD applies only to CM5 Lite."
		(at 25.4 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "196371c7-fb44-4ef6-abdf-55d11152d382")
	)
	(text "USB-C is the 5V input and USB2 device/recovery port.\nCM5 CC1/CC2 negotiate power; no external 5.1k Rd.\nGPIO 5V is directly the same rail; use one supply at a time."
		(at 455.93 580.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fca33d33-f3b2-4bdc-bd44-5c544ebb6446")
	)
	(text "Power declarations: USB-C supplies 5V and GND;\nGPIO_VREF is supplied through the fitted H2 shunt (default 2-3)."
